-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Zinkx Arena is an independent, open-source graphical user interface (GUI) and
library organizer for macOS.

1. NO COPYRIGHTED MATERIAL INCLUDED:
   This repository does NOT contain, distribute, link to, or facilitate the
   downloading of any copyrighted game files (ROMs, ISOs, PKGs), BIOS dumps,
   system firmware (PUP), cryptographic keys, or proprietary assets.
   All titles and cover artworks shown in documentation screenshots are 100%
   original, procedurally generated fictional/homebrew showcase placeholders.

2. ANTI-PIRACY POLICY:
   The author(s) of Zinkx Arena strictly oppose software piracy. Users are
   solely responsible for complying with local copyright laws and must only
   use this launcher with their own legally purchased and personally dumped
   physical game media or homebrew software.

